# ── Certbot (Let's Encrypt) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bind-mounted into the `certbot` service so it survives `docker compose
# down -v` — holds the ACME account key + issued certs, not app secrets, but
# still shouldn't be committed (host-specific, regenerable, and large).
docker/certbot/letsencrypt/*
!docker/certbot/letsencrypt/.gitkeep